&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;适合拿来给 AI 知识库、文档问答做 PDF 预检。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👉&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82072/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82072/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/u9o9fjaQmRjE0wy-oOodejToHI9T8Bok3SzhBF8l7J6q_iDuqC3TrIuEL3Dy65QNBr10g_8wH1Qxu87A0_GxURHs-GDWID4P8u_twrBmgLpFgAb-MEgIEcoD-c5eNTmLVG8Y1Q9jvJz8itD1nkoZ8wcogO5gBH86QvT_mNtx-U3w-HNVJsousIHPn-wSVrb1oK1y4OwcVY1vaRhTgtdlpt4HgWTlXrbuXEBuigeuTMLkFhGmpkQ3FSMV9Vd8khnX3iRas0oc3l-MjFrD0Z5TJIM5_NzARsGBccfuMECUkit-abbRx6MlwGqkn-lbsKlFKlAGW2IJAldY0VJyft9zHQ.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13060</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13060</guid><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 09:47:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 电脑用了一整天，过几天却想不起当时具体干了什么？</title><description>&lt;p&gt;电脑用了一整天，过几天却想不起当时具体干了什么？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dayflow AI 时间追踪工具会自动记录 Mac 上的屏幕活动，并整理成时间线、Standup 和 Weekly Review。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;支持 Ollama / LM Studio 本地模型，也能接 Gemini、ChatGPT、Claude。开源、MIT。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👉&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82056/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82056/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/m6jqt_kAFtTTC1otIfx5YNZWdgmN3FhmzlsW1RNkuJDS3aSKUyWXuWGXP8KLjrBjxYVGxgkcI3Zem1Bm5pOM8mOuByKo9bCXVcnPHXHJ4pmVRoV8XET_srjnGWl0Zn0h8a3kFADqHNkA2cVu_FDpzLjQY2T4PpOCmuMomeWVuG8J7uMSPfKbrbdJ0-8Yt1VbkaFZv50U6aRZbnIUhJIE28mSL7qCYlldMqYqAM4mwsJS6L-Xs4HApVHgcVQRJYZs8dLL-dxykE4lsbsyZ7fPH7BNG8-Ht9VqGUN-7HOyuDriGeo_6EYmhkJzw9Nwxoeen7jGVHiKFjqCKy-jFXyYfg.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13059</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13059</guid><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 16:47:56 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>